│ patch_description        │ Rather than repeatedly descending from a few repaired samples, this approach maintains a  │
│                          │ small, diverse set of networks and runs annealed walks from them. LP detail identifies    │
│                          │ bottleneck links, which are preferentially included in degree-preserving exchanges;       │
│                          │ occasional three-link rotations add a different neighborhood. The free surrogate energy   │
│                          │ ranks proposals before LP evaluation, while temperature-based acceptance lets walks cross │
│                          │ local barriers. Cached and duplicate networks are skipped so the LP budget is spent on    │
│                          │ new topologies.                                                                           │
