│ patch_description        │ This approach uses repaired QAOA candidates to seed a diverse, LP-scored elite, then      │
│                          │ alternates focused neighborhood search with controlled basin escapes. LP dual prices and  │
│                          │ high loads identify links worth changing; promising two-link exchanges are ranked cheaply │
│                          │ with the surrogate energy, while occasional targeted three-link rotations explore moves   │
│                          │ unavailable to pair exchanges. Rather than continually sampling random neighbors, the     │
│                          │ search periodically revisits elite networks and perturbs the incumbent, directing the LP  │
│                          │ budget toward distinct candidates likely to improve the best known network.               │
