│ patch_description        │ Rather than spending most LP calls on neighborhoods around individual networks, this      │
│                          │ approach uses an evolutionary archive: it recombines links from distinct high-quality     │
│                          │ parents, repairs each offspring, and evaluates a small, diverse, surrogate-ranked batch.  │
│                          │ Degree-preserving mutations add variation, while elitist replacement and occasional       │
│                          │ restarts preserve both strong solutions and alternative topologies. This explores         │
│                          │ combinations of good substructures that ordinary local descent may not reach.             │
