│                          │ link demand. Each batch reserves LP calls for both price-favored and energy-favored       │
│                          │ moves, plus a small exploratory slice. The archive size, batch size, neighborhood mix,    │
│                          │ and diversity policy are configured to balance focused improvement with escape from local │
