│                          │ miss useful switches involving bottleneck links. Enumerating every pair of current links  │
│                          │ is inexpensive for a 2-in/2-out network (only 276 pairs when there are 24 links) and      │
│                          │ ensures that all valid switches involving at least one hot link enter the proposal pool.  │
│                          │ The existing batch ranking and diversity selection still limit the number of costly LP    │
│                          │ evaluations, while the randomized three-edge rotations preserve broader exploration.      │
