│ patch_description        │ This design combines a small, quality-and-diversity archive with path relinking between   │
│                          │ valid networks. Rather than repeatedly building large rotation neighborhoods, it moves a  │
│                          │ parent toward a different archive member by applying degree-preserving switches that      │
│                          │ introduce that member’s links. Candidate moves are screened using energy and dual-price   │
│                          │ change, but a small number of alternatives are retained so those imperfect signals do not │
│                          │ become hard filters. Short LP batches then update the archive, with occasional randomized │
│                          │ transitions to explore beyond the current relinking paths.                                │
