│ patch_description        │ The current search generates small random kicks from whichever parent happens to be       │
│                          │ selected, but it does not escalate exploration when the whole search stagnates. Track     │
│                          │ global progress and, after a stall, perturb a non-elite archive member rather than the    │
│                          │ incumbent. Bias the kick’s switches toward that donor’s priced or heavily loaded links,   │
│                          │ while retaining the existing random switches for broader exploration. The archive is      │
│                          │ refreshed from scored networks, so the elite remains available and the kicked topology is │
│                          │ evaluated as a new search start.                                                          │
