│                          │ a diverse population from repaired QAOA samples, then alternates dual-guided link         │
│                          │ switches with recombination: a child inherits links from two strong but structurally      │
│                          │ distinct networks and uses the free repair tool to restore degree constraints. Candidate  │
│                          │ moves are screened using energy and bottleneck prices, while a small exploration quota    │
│                          │ prevents the surrogate from dictating every LP call. The population retains both strong   │
│                          │ and diverse networks so search can move between basins.                                   │
