│ patch_name               │ archive_kicks                                                                             │
│ patch_description        │ Periodically branch from an underexplored non-elite archive member rather than repeatedly │
│                          │ sampling the same strong states. Apply a short sequence of degree-preserving              │
│                          │ two-switches, preferring switches that touch bottleneck links but falling back to         │
