│                          │ exhaustive two-switch neighborhoods ranked by both dual-price gain and energy. It keeps a │
│                          │ compact, diverse archive, searches the incumbent frequently, and uses occasional          │
│                          │ rotations and longer kicks to escape local basins. Batches are smaller than the current   │
│                          │ program’s nine-call batches to allow more frequent adaptation to LP results.              │
